---
import SocialList from "@/components/SocialList.astro";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<PageLayout
	searchable
	meta={{
		title: "About",
		description:
			"PhD candidate at UC Merced studying collective cell dynamics, multicellular networks, cell adhesion, and pattern formation",
	}}
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px]">
		<h1 class="title mb-6">About</h1>

		<section aria-label="Introduction" class="mb-16">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,380px)_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-14 lg:gap-20">
				<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[360px] py-4 sm:max-w-[380px]">
					<figure
						class="relative mx-auto -rotate-6 border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 pb-12 shadow-lg transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-0 motion-reduce:transition-none sm:p-5 sm:pb-14 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-900"
					>
						<img
							src="/icons/profile.jpg"
							alt="Suraj Sahu"
							width="1872"
							height="1656"
							class="block aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover object-[center_78%]"
							fetchpriority="high"
						/>
					</figure>
				</div>

				<div class="min-w-0 space-y-5 text-base leading-7">
					<p class="text-global-text">
						I'm a PhD candidate at the <a
							class="cactus-link"
							href="http://gopinathanlab.ucmerced.edu"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">Gopinathan Lab</a
						> at the <a
							class="cactus-link"
							href="https://www.ucmerced.edu"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">University of California, Merced</a
						>.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text">
						My research interests lie at the interface of biology and physics. I am fascinated by
						questions related to self-organization in collective systems, how living systems make
						beautiful structures and patterns, and the mechanobiology of cells and tissues. For my
						PhD thesis, I work on the formation and remodeling of multicellular networks, the
						physics of cell–cell adhesion and cell–matrix interactions, and pattern formation.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text">
						I use theoretical modeling and computational methods like agent-based modeling,
						particle-based simulations, and some occasional image analysis. You can find them in <a
							class="cactus-link"
							href="/research/">Research</a
						>.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text">
						As someone who got into science by watching and reading Carl Sagan, Richard Feynman, and
						others, I strongly believe that science should be for all and that we should take
						science outreach as seriously as our usual job. As teachers, I also believe it is our
						role to make the uncurious curious and invite the skeptic to wonder.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text">
						Academia is tough! As someone who often feels lost, mentoring and mutual support are the
						only way to make academia worth pursuing!
					</p>
					<blockquote class="border-link text-link border-l-2 pl-4 italic">
						<p>
							"Books! And cleverness! There are more important things — friendship and bravery."
						</p>
						<footer class="mt-1 text-sm not-italic">
							— Hermione Granger, <em>Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone</em>
						</footer>
					</blockquote>
					<nav aria-label="Social profiles" class="flex justify-center pt-2 md:justify-start">
						<SocialList />
					</nav>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section
			aria-labelledby="communication-note"
			class="mb-10 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8 dark:border-neutral-800"
		>
			<h2 id="communication-note" class="text-accent-2 mb-3 text-base font-semibold">
				A Note on Communication
			</h2>
			<p class="text-global-text text-sm leading-relaxed italic">
				I really appreciate your understanding as I navigate my professional landscape with ADHD and
				OCD. My approach to work and communication may be unique, such as how I prioritize tasks,
				but I am committed to ensuring that our exchanges are effective and clear. In case I don't
				get back to you right away, please don't hesitate to send me a reminder. I value your
				patience and feedback. May the Force be with you!
			</p>
		</section>

		<section
			aria-labelledby="affiliations"
			class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-10 dark:border-neutral-800"
		>
			<h2 id="affiliations" class="text-accent-2 mb-6 text-xl font-semibold">Affiliations</h2>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
				<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
					<a
						href="https://www.ucmerced.edu"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener"
						class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white p-1.5 dark:border-neutral-800"
					>
						<img src="/icons/ucmerced.webp" alt="UC Merced" class="h-full w-full object-contain" />
					</a>
					<div class="min-w-0 space-y-1 leading-snug">
						<p class="font-semibold">
							<a
								class="text-accent-2 hover:text-link transition-colors hover:underline"
								href="https://www.ucmerced.edu"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener">University of California, Merced</a
							>
						</p>
						<p class="text-global-text text-sm leading-normal">
							Graduate Researcher, <a
								class="cactus-link"
								href="http://gopinathanlab.ucmerced.edu"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener">Gopinathan Group</a
							>
						</p>
						<p class="text-global-text text-sm leading-normal">
							<a
								class="cactus-link"
								href="https://physics.ucmerced.edu"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener">Department of Physics</a
							>
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
					<a
						href="https://cemb.upenn.edu"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener"
						class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white p-1.5 dark:border-neutral-800"
					>
						<img src="/icons/cemb.png" alt="CEMB" class="h-full w-full object-contain" />
					</a>
					<div class="min-w-0 space-y-1 leading-snug">
						<p class="font-semibold">
							<a
								class="text-accent-2 hover:text-link transition-colors hover:underline"
								href="https://cemb.upenn.edu"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener">Center for Engineering MechanoBiology</a
							>
						</p>
						<p class="text-global-text text-sm leading-normal">UPenn</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
					<a
						href="https://ccbm.ucmerced.edu"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener"
						class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white p-1.5 dark:border-neutral-800"
					>
						<img src="/icons/ccbm.png" alt="CCBM" class="h-full w-full object-contain" />
					</a>
					<div class="min-w-0 space-y-1 leading-snug">
						<p class="font-semibold">
							<a
								class="text-accent-2 hover:text-link transition-colors hover:underline"
								href="https://ccbm.ucmerced.edu"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener">Center for Cellular and Biomolecular Machines</a
							>
						</p>
						<p class="text-global-text text-sm leading-normal">UC Merced</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
